      "with": ["preparation/tomato-sauce", "ingredient/water", "ingredient/basil"],
      "text": "Lift the {pasta} into the sauce with a splash of the cooking {water} and toss over the heat until the sauce clings to every strand. Take the pan off the heat and stir in the {basil}.",
